wclip (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * In-memory and bbolt storage backends (STORE env var).
  * Optional HTTP Basic Auth (HTTP_USER / HTTP_PASSWORD).
  * CORS headers on all responses.
  * /robots.txt fallback.
  * Systemd unit running as the wclip system user.

 -- Oleg Pudeyev <code@olegp.name>  Wed, 07 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
